# Deep zoom perturbation experiment
prototype/deep-zoom/

# Palette library — baked by `npm run bake:palette` from H:/GMT/stuff/palette-lab
# (NOT in this repo, so a clean checkout / CI cannot regenerate these). Which gradient lands in
# which pack is debug/palette-packs.mts; what each pack's sources require is its credits file.
#  • core.*, credits.core.*, catalog-sigs.json = TRACKED. Always loaded. NOT a single permissive
#    licence: uiGradients MIT, ColorBrewer Apache-2.0, Matplotlib per family, and PyPalettes, a
#    GPL-3.0 package whose palettes keep their upstream licences (MIT, GPL-2/3, CC0, Apache-2.0,
#    CC BY 4.0, CC BY-SA 4.0). The credits file is what makes shipping it honest — keep them together.
#  • softology.*  = ignored — Softology/Visions of Chaos aggregate, origins unverified. R2 CDN, lazy.
#  • cptcity.*    = ignored — per-archive licences (restricted archives separated out). R2 CDN, lazy.
#  • elvensword.* = ignored — ElvenSword under its own name. R2 CDN, lazy.
#  • noncommercial.* = ignored — the OPTIONAL non-commercial pack: uploaded, off by default in the app.
#  • publish:false packs (palette/core/catalogPacks.ts) are written to palette-lab/out/unpublished/,
#    never here; the bake deletes a pack's files from here once it is switched to false.
public/palette/softology.bin.gz
public/palette/softology.json.gz
public/palette/cptcity.bin.gz
public/palette/cptcity.json.gz
public/palette/noncommercial.bin.gz
public/palette/noncommercial.json.gz
public/palette/elvensword.bin.gz
public/palette/elvensword.json.gz
public/palette/credits.softology.*
public/palette/credits.cptcity.*
public/palette/credits.noncommercial.*
public/palette/credits.elvensword.*

